		"description": "<p><em>Toolbelt upgrade of your <strong>Elixir B</strong> gadget — use this instead of the gadget item to activate it with the greater effect for 2 Toolbelt scraps total.</em></p><p><em>Gadget — A stat-boosting elixir.</em></p><p><strong>1 Action.</strong> Gain +1 to a stat of your choice for 2 turns.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt:</strong> Lasts 1 minute; you are Stunned for 1 turn after the effect ends.</p><p><strong>Passive:</strong> Temp HP you receive increases by 1.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Spends 2 Toolbelt scraps — tracked on the sheet (click the counter to correct mistakes).</em></p><p><em>[M] Apply the +1 stat bonus for 1 minute, then Stunned for 1 turn.</em></p>",
